VIA UK prototype

## Quick start (recommended — includes PostgreSQL)

No manual `DATABASE_URL` needed. Docker Compose starts Postgres + backend + frontend:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ragroad/viausuk.git
cd viausuk
docker compose up --build
```

| Service  | URL |
|----------|-----|
| Frontend | http://localhost:5173 |
| Backend  | http://localhost:3001 |
| Health   | http://localhost:3001/health |

Postgres runs automatically with:
`postgresql://postgres:postgres@postgres:5432/via`

