## Expose backend with ngrok (local demo)

**Terminal 1** — start the stack:
```bash
docker compose up postgres backend
```

**Terminal 2** — expose backend:
```bash
ngrok http 3001
```

Copy the ngrok HTTPS URL (e.g. `https://abc123.ngrok-free.app`).

**Terminal 3** — frontend pointing at ngrok:
```bash
cd frontend
VITE_API_URL=https://abc123.ngrok-free.app/api/v1 npm run dev
```

> ngrok tunnels to your Mac — not cloud hosting. Your machine must stay on.

